# Skills installed by `repo-mapped` from the spore binary's BundledSkills
# embed. Source lives at bootstrap/skills/, so committing this snapshot
# would create a drift target. Downstream consumers (no embed source
# in-tree) commit their .claude/skills/; spore-as-project does not.
/.claude/skills/

# local secrets (never commit). Deploy credentials live on the host, not
# the repo (see docs/deploy.md), so nothing secret-bearing is tracked.
secrets.env
*.local.nix
